    "name": "PLOY Hostel",
    "detail": "The hostel is nearby Khaosan road. I booked for an 8 beds mixed room. The receptionist accompany me to a 14 bunk bed mixed room. I told him that I booked and paid on an 8 beds mixed dorm. Gladly he transfer me to what I have booked. I stayed on the second floor, 8 bunk beds. Room got ambient temperature. There are 3 toilets and a 1 shower on the second floor. No hot shower though.... Free tea, coffee and drinking water. Breakfast is free: Strawberry jam or butter for your bread toast. They have lockers for your personal stuffs and bring your own padlocks. My stay was pleasant. ",
